  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-900 via-orange-950 to-stone-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>🍁</span><span>2026年 秋〜初冬旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      秋の紅葉見頃シーズンや連休の温泉宿は早期割引プランが人気です。希望の日程はお早めの空室チェックが安心です。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D29756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    👉 柳川川下り＆うなぎのせいろ蒸しおすすめ宿セレクションの自慢の温泉＆空室状況を見る →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】福岡・柳川の川下り乗船場近く＆名物うなぎのせいろ蒸しおすすめ老舗旅館比較！立花邸御花・白柳荘・亀の井ホテル</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🚣 柳川どんこ舟川下りと名物「柳川川下り＆うなぎのせいろ蒸しおすすめ宿セレクション」の魅力</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">船頭の竿さばきと舟歌を聴きながら堀割を進む「柳川川下り＆うなぎのせいろ蒸しおすすめ宿セレクション」。下船後は、秘伝のタレを絡めたご飯に蒲焼きうなぎと錦糸卵を乗せて蒸し上げたアツアツの「柳川川下り＆うなぎのせいろ蒸しおすすめ宿セレクション」をいただくのが柳川観光の黄金ルートです。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 水郷・柳川で後悔しない厳選宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">柳川藩主立花邸　御花</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.86</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/29756/29756.jpg\" alt=\"柳川藩主立花邸　御花 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 旧柳川藩主立花家の本邸に泊まる唯一無二の体験！名勝庭園「柳川川下り＆うなぎのせいろ蒸しおすすめ宿セレクション」とうなぎ会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">国指定名勝の日本庭園「柳川川下り＆うなぎのせいろ蒸しおすすめ宿セレクション」や大広間を有する歴史の宿。川下りの終着点に位置し、夜の静かな庭園ライトアップを宿泊者限定で独占。本場柳川の極上うなぎのせいろ蒸し会席が味わえます。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>歴史好き、記念日、ご夫婦、本物の大名文化とおもてなしに浸りたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>旧藩主邸の名勝庭園と本場うなぎせいろ蒸しを体験するなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D29756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition tra